                                "sense_id": "c58f9dfb-fb2f-3902-bd7d-0277c563f4c7",
                                "text": "From his short passes to the hip-length tan winter coat he slipped on after the game, Pennington proved in myriad ways that he was all about being practical, not peacocky."
